      "title": "Opn Form API Token",
      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "Paste a Personal Access Token from OpnForm Settings \u2192 Access Tokens. Include workspaces-read for connection evidence, forms-read for form reads, forms-write for changes, workspace-users-read for members, and manage-integrations for webhooks. Workspace changes need workspaces-write. NoClick sends the token only to api.opnform.com.",
      "x-credential-url": "https://docs.opnform.com/api-reference/introduction"
    },
